{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Blessed are you in the city.</b> In the commandments that you perform in the city, such as sukkah, mezuzah, and ma'akeh." "<b>And blessed are you in the field.</b> In the commandments of leket, shikhchah, and pe'ah. Another interpretation: 'Blessed are you in the city' — this is Jerusalem, which is called the holy city. 'And blessed are you in the field' — this is Zion, as it is said of it: ״ציון שדה תחרש״."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:23.083063360Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}